				<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/fawn/fawn.png&#34; alt=&#34;&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;fawn&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Fawn&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#fawn&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Nmap:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;nmap -sV 10.129.131.99&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Starting Nmap 7.99 &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt; https://nmap.org &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; at 2026-07-31 16:20 +0200&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Nmap scan report &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ff7b72&#34;&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; 10.129.131.99&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Host is up &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;0.011s latency&lt;span style=&#34;color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;.&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Not shown: &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a5d6ff&#34;&gt;999&lt;/span&gt; closed tcp ports &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;conn-refused&lt;span style=&#34;color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;PORT   STATE SERVICE VERSION&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;21/tcp open  ftp     vsftpd 3.0.3&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Service Info: OS: Unix&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Service detection performed. Please report any incorrect results at https://nmap.org/submit/ .&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Nmap &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ff7b72&#34;&gt;done&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a5d6ff&#34;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt; IP address &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a5d6ff&#34;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt; host up&lt;span style=&#34;color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; scanned in 3.04 seconds&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Only FTP open.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
