				<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/meow/meow-front.png&#34; alt=&#34;&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;nmapping&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Nmapping&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#nmapping&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;We start the box, and nmap it.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;nmap:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;nmap -sV 10.129.123.103&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-terminaloutput&#34; data-lang=&#34;terminaloutput&#34;&gt;Starting Nmap 7.99 ( https://nmap.org ) at 2026-07-27 12:58 +0200&#xA;Nmap scan report for 10.129.123.103&#xA;Host is up (0.011s latency).&#xA;Not shown: 999 closed tcp ports (conn-refused)&#xA;PORT   STATE SERVICE VERSION&#xA;23/tcp open  telnet  Linux telnetd&#xA;Service Info: OS: Linux; CPE: cpe:/o:linux:linux_kernel&#xA;&#xA;Service detection performed. Please report any incorrect results at https://nmap.org/submit/ .&#xA;Nmap done: 1 IP address (1 host up) scanned in 13.21 seconds&#xA;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;Telnet is open for business. Let&amp;rsquo;s try to connect to it.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
